{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Those Bugs Away From The Bomb is your ticket to a fast-paced bullet-hell adventure with heaps upon heaps of weapons, upgrades and unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/69275a6c1bad1a70f88750e7cc6ca9be.poster.avif?t=1764680654\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/69275a6c1bad1a70f88750e7cc6ca9be.webm?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/69275a6c1bad1a70f88750e7cc6ca9be.mp4?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through waves of hideous enemies, rescue survivors, expand your roster of playable characters, add new weapons, and skills to your arsenal, and most importantly, where you\u2019ll KEEP\u2026 THOSE BUGS\u2026 AWAY\u2026 FROM\u2026 THE BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/33ecc7b02ca8026c10f535a087b65cd0.poster.avif?t=1764680654\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/33ecc7b02ca8026c10f535a087b65cd0.webm?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/33ecc7b02ca8026c10f535a087b65cd0.mp4?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KTBAFTB offers a virtually endless gameplay with ever-increasing difficulty. Unlock and wield dozens of weapons divided into four destructive categories: metal, fire, electric, and nuclear. Enhance them with various power-ups scattered throughout the levels to become the bullet- hell and KEEP\u2026 THOSE BUGS\u2026 AWAY\u2026 FROM\u2026 THE BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.poster.avif?t=1764680654\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.webm?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.mp4?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A motley crew of playable characters to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of skills and power-ups to upgrade your heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of automated weapons that fire as you move around the levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of alien enemies with different behaviors and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEEPING THOSE BUGS AWAY FROM THE BOMB</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2133500?t=1764680654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2133500?t=1764680654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764680654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764680654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"desc