 offers a virtually endless gameplay with ever-increasing difficulty. Unlock and wield dozens of weapons divided into four destructive categories: metal, fire, electric, and nuclear. Enhance them with various power-ups scattered throughout the levels to become the bullet- hell and KEEP\u2026 THOSE BUGS\u2026 AWAY\u2026 FROM\u2026 THE BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.poster.avif?t=1764680654\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.webm?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/extras/5bced2c657c90159750d2b7cad716f02.mp4?t=1764680654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A motley crew of playable characters to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of skills and power-ups to upgrade your heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of automated weapons that fire as you move around the levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of alien enemies with different behaviors and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEEPING THOSE BUGS AWAY FROM THE BOMB</p></li></ul>","developers":["small bros"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133500/header.jpg?t=1764680654","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Retrovibe \u00a9 2023 small bros<br />\r\nKTBAFTB, Keep Those Bugs Away From The Bomb and the Keep Those Bugs Away From The Bomb logo are trademarks of small bros. All rights reserved.","linux_requirem